      "text": [
        " لِكُلِّ شَيْ‏ءٍ زَكَاةٌ وَ زَكَاةُ الْأَجْسَادِ الصَّوْمُ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Ali Bin Al Hakam, from Musa Bin Bakr who said, ",
          "‘For everything is Zakaat, and a Zakaat of the bodies is the Fast’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "4. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from Ali ibn al-Hakam from Musa ibn Bakr who has said the following: “He (the Imam), ‘Alayhi al-Salam, said, ‘Everything has a cleanser; the cleanser for bodies is fasting.” "
        ]
      }
